{"sections":{"main":{"type":"page-contact","disabled":true,"settings":{}},"1770561381e1b8f6bb":{"type":"_blocks","blocks":{"ai_gen_block_500a125_dEKNRy":{"type":"ai_gen_block_500a125","settings":{"hero_headline":"PRIVATE CLOTHING. MEMBERS ONLY.","hero_subheading":"Entry is granted. Releases are curated.","hero_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/boys-wearing-t-shirts-stylish.png","hero_image_opacity":30,"hero_bg_gradient":"linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(0, 0, 0, 1), rgba(40, 40, 40, 1) 100%)","hero_text_align":"center","hero_font":"sans_serif_n4","hero_enable_animation":true,"content_1_title":"What We Are","content_1_description":"Entitled Club is a private clothing brand built on selection. We handpick menswear that meets a strict standard, then release it in controlled drops. We prioritise quality over quantity — so every collection feels exclusive by design.","content_1_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/boys-waring-funcky-t-shirts-with-name-entitled-club.png","content_1_image_curve":"all","content_1_layout":"text_left","content_1_bg_gradient":"linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(60, 60, 60, 1), rgba(100, 100, 100, 1) 100%)","content_1_text_color":"#ffffff","content_1_font":"sans_serif_n4","content_1_hover_effect":"image_zoom","content_1_enable_animation":true,"content_2_title":"How Access Works","content_2_description":"Access is members-only. To enter, you apply with your details. Approvals are typically granted within 10–15 days. Once approved, you have always-on access to the storefront.","content_2_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/access-is-members-only-to-enter-you-apply-with-your-details-approvals-are-typically-granted-within-10-15-days-once-approved-you-have-always-on-access-to-the-storefront-this-is-section.png","content_2_image_curve":"none","content_2_layout":"image_left","content_2_bg_gradient":"linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(100, 100, 100, 1), rgba(245, 245, 245, 1) 100%)","content_2_text_color":"#333333","content_2_font":"sans_serif_n4","content_2_hover_effect":"card_lift","content_2_enable_animation":true,"content_3_title":"Curation Philosophy","content_3_description":"We do not stock at scale. We curate. Our drops are built around scarcity that is real: few pieces, limited quantities, and clean selection. We keep the storefront quiet so the product stays primary.","content_3_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/this-is-t-shirt-salling-store-so-create-a-image-like-a-mens-wearing-colorfull-t-shrts.png","content_3_image_curve":"none","content_3_layout":"text_left","content_3_bg_gradient":"linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(0, 0, 0, 1), rgba(70, 70, 70, 1) 100%)","content_3_text_color":"#ffffff","content_3_font":"sans_serif_n4","content_3_hover_effect":"title_underline","content_3_enable_animation":true,"content_4_title":"Authenticity & Quality","content_4_description":"We source only through select authentic channels. Every piece is checked for legitimacy and overall quality before it is listed. We do not pass on quality rejects or defective inventory.","content_4_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/create-a-image-that-showing-the-t-shirts-quality-fabric-texture.png","content_4_image_curve":"none","content_4_layout":"image_left","content_4_bg_gradient":"linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(50, 50, 50, 1), rgba(120, 120, 120, 1) 100%)","content_4_text_color":"#ffffff","content_4_font":"sans_serif_n4","content_4_hover_effect":"image_desaturate","content_4_enable_animation":true,"content_5_title":"Drops & Archive","content_5_description":"Most of our releases follow the drop model. A drop opens, members shop, and then the drop closes. When it closes, it becomes archive. We do not restock by default. The chapter ends.","content_5_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/make-a-image-that-include-a-men-wearing-t-shirts-with-small-name-entitled-club-also-in-that-show-the-fabric-quality.png","content_5_image_curve":"none","content_5_layout":"text_left","content_5_bg_gradient":"linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(65, 75, 85, 1), rgba(160, 160, 160, 1) 100%)","content_5_